OL,3,GNEWSAMoment Peter Kay gatecrashes BBC
OL,4,Aweather report
OL,5,
OL,6,FComedian Peter Kay gatecrashed a BBC
OL,7,Fweather report live on air.
OL,9,FBBC North West Tonight's Molly Brewer
OL,10,Fwas presenting her report when Kay
OL,11,Fjoined her on screen.
OL,13,FThe Bolton comedian's impromptu
OL,14,Fappearance was reminiscent of when he
OL,15,Ffamously interrupted the late Dianne
OL,16,FOxberry's forecast in 2011, and
OL,17,Fdeclared she "made it sunshine for
OL,18,Feverybody".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
